1
00:00:00,697 --> 00:00:02,997
(Sheldon:)...by making a gesture that says,
"Get a load of this guy."

2
00:00:05,502 --> 00:00:06,872
(Leonard:)Fine, Howard, what do you do?

3
00:00:07,037 --> 00:00:12,907
(Howard:)I follow the ogre tracks,
checking for secret doors along the way.

4
00:00:13,076 --> 00:00:15,946
(Leonard:)And you discover a secret door
leading to a dark corridor.

5
00:00:16,113 --> 00:00:19,383
Let's make a plan. Spellcasters in the back,
warriors in the front.

6
00:00:19,549 --> 00:00:24,149
(Raj:)Screw that noise, I'm going in.
Hang on, Santa, I'm coming for you.

7
00:00:25,222 --> 00:00:29,952
(Leonard:)Okay. You run into a room full of weapons,
hit a trip wire.

8
00:00:32,062 --> 00:00:35,092
(Leonard:)A cannon blows your face off.
You die, you're out of the game.

9
00:00:36,099 --> 00:00:38,069
What? A cannon?

10
00:00:38,235 --> 00:00:39,895
(Raj:)Am I really out of the game?

11
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,730
(Sheldon:)Lucky.

12
00:00:42,639 --> 00:00:43,799
(Leonard:)Okay, come on. Moving on.

13
00:00:43,974 --> 00:00:46,844
(Raj:)Wait, doesn't anyone have
a rod of resurrection?

14
00:00:47,044 --> 00:00:50,074
(Raj:)Because if you've got one, I need it bad.

15
00:00:51,948 --> 00:00:54,918
(Raj:)Get in here with your rod
and give it to me.

16
00:00:56,353 --> 00:01:02,023
(Stuart:)Okay, you need to say these things
in your head before you say them out loud.

